    {
      "factor": "Risk Management",
      "polarity": 1,
      "reason_headline": "Appropriate Risk Assessment",
      "reason_detailed": "The agent assesses the risk level of the trade as medium and later seeks profitable trades with varying risk levels, demonstrating an understanding of risk management principles."
